dta_parser bundles Rust code from this repository (the dta and
dta-parquet crates, GPL-3.0-only) and these crates from crates.io, at
the versions in python/Cargo.lock.

Compiled into the package, for reading and writing Parquet files:

  snap 1.1.2             BSD-3-Clause   https://github.com/BurntSushi/rust-snappy
  lz4_flex 0.11.6        MIT            https://github.com/pseitz/lz4_flex
  miniz_oxide 0.8.9      MIT OR Zlib OR Apache-2.0
                                        https://github.com/Frommi/miniz_oxide
  adler2 2.0.1           0BSD OR MIT OR Apache-2.0
                                        https://github.com/oyvindln/adler2
  brotli-decompressor 6.2.0
                         BSD-3-Clause OR MIT
                                        https://github.com/dropbox/rust-brotli-decompressor
  alloc-no-stdlib 3.0.0, alloc-stdlib 0.3.0
                         BSD-3-Clause   https://github.com/dropbox/rust-alloc-no-stdlib
  zstd 0.13.4            BSD-3-Clause   https://github.com/gyscos/zstd-rs
  zstd-safe 7.4.0        BSD-3-Clause   https://github.com/gyscos/zstd-rs
  zstd-sys 2.1.2         BSD-3-Clause   https://github.com/gyscos/zstd-rs
    with Zstandard (libzstd) 1.5.7, by Meta Platforms, Inc. and
    affiliates, BSD-3-Clause (dual-licensed BSD or GPLv2)
                                        https://github.com/facebook/zstd

Compiled into the package, for the bridge to Python:

  pyo3 0.27.2 (with pyo3-ffi, pyo3-macros, pyo3-macros-backend and
  pyo3-build-config)     MIT OR Apache-2.0
                                        https://github.com/PyO3/pyo3

